@page "/about"
<PageTitle>Your Guide · DiaperScout</PageTitle>
<section class="pwa-guide-page">
    <p class="pwa-eyebrow">A guide to the guide</p><h1>Find your next option.</h1>
    <p>DiaperScout is an explorer’s guide to absorbent products. Start with a product, choose a variant, then select your size and pack. Where to Buy shows verified retailer links for that exact pack.</p>
    <div class="pwa-paper-panel"><h2>A place to explore.</h2><p>Use search and filters to discover products and compare their recorded features. Retailer pages can change; check the retailer for current price and stock before buying.</p><a class="ds-button ds-button-primary" href="/products">Explore products</a></div>
    <div class="pwa-paper-panel"><h2>Take the guide with you.</h2><p>On a supported browser, you can install DiaperScout for a full-screen app experience. Everything also works in your browser.</p>
        <button type="button" class="ds-button ds-button-secondary" data-pwa-install hidden>Install DiaperScout</button>
        <p data-pwa-ios hidden>On iPhone or iPad, open the browser’s Share menu, then choose <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>.</p>
        <p class="pwa-muted">A connection is needed for current products and retailer information. Your device’s installation options may vary.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pwa-paper-panel"><h2>Your account.</h2><p>Sign in to use the tools available to your role and manage your passkeys.</p><a href="/signin" class="ds-button ds-button-secondary">Sign in</a></div>
</section>
